  "body": "Wira Lane, Silverdale\r\n\r\nLooking for a quality new home with space, style and convenience? Now is the time to make your move!\r\n\r\nThese beautifully designed 4-bedroom homes offer modern family living with flexible spaces and quality features.\r\n\r\n• 4 generous bedrooms, including a downstairs bedroom and bathroom\r\n• Spacious master suite with walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n• Separate lounge/media room\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Double glazing, air conditioning and digital door lock\r\n• Internal-access double garage + off-street parking\r\n• 10-Year Stamford Warranty for peace of mind\r\n\r\nConveniently located near Dairy Flat School, Orewa College, Silverdale Mall, motorway access, local shops and beautiful Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nMotivated vendor — keen to see these homes SOLD! Don't miss this opportunity to secure your new home in Silverdale.",
